simultaneously and have the same scope as each other.  The sample procedure
@code{f} above can be written without internal definitions, but with exactly
the same meaning, as the frame-first arrangement

@example kotlin
GVarStmt("isEven", GNull)        // every name created
GVarStmt("isOdd", GNull)         // before any value
GAssignStmt("isEven",
